    "title": "Baker County fires top priority in the nation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jayson Jacoby ,\n18 hours ago BAKER CITY — Two fires burning in the Wallowa-Whitman National Forest north of Sumpter in Baker County are the top firefighting priorities in the nation. “That gives us some additional priority in ordering resources we think we need,” Bill Queen, an information officer for the incident management team overseeing firefighting efforts on both blazes, said Wednesday morning, Aug. 26. Read full article\n2",
